ROS 2 message types the console needs that asterism does not bundle.

rcl_interfaces/msg/Log.rb was generated by asterism's tools/asterism_msggen.rb
(asterism 0.4.0) from the ROS 2 Jazzy definition rcl_interfaces/msg/Log.msg
(https://github.com/ros2/rcl_interfaces), with builtin_interfaces/msg/Time
taken from asterism's own data/msgs. The definition is licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0 (LICENSE-Apache-2.0.txt), and so is the
generated file. Copyright in the definition belongs to its authors (Open
Source Robotics Foundation, Inc. and the ROS 2 contributors).

Regenerate with (the share directory of a ROS 2 Jazzy install):

  ruby ../asterism/tools/asterism_msggen.rb -I ../asterism/tools/ros2_jazzy \
    -I /opt/ros/jazzy/share -o /tmp/gen rcl_interfaces/msg/Log
  cp /tmp/gen/rcl_interfaces/msg/Log.rb vendor/msgs/rcl_interfaces/msg/
